    <briefdescription>
<para>Release-gate benchmark for Query/RAG FTS phrase and proximity queries. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Measures p50/p95/p99 query latency on deterministic 10K and 100K corpora using the production <computeroutput>FtsExecutor</computeroutput> and its on-disk index path. The 100K scenario is the binding release gate for the remaining Query FTS acceptance item (<computeroutput>p95 &lt;= 100 ms</computeroutput>). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
